DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280710
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280711
SUMMARY:Get ready: 2028 general election in 120 days
DESCRIPTION:On the ballot:\n- City: Phoenix mayor and odd-numbered council 
 districts (expected\, not yet official)\n- School district: School board s
 eats and any district bond or override measures (expected\, not yet offici
 al)\n- County: County offices in every county (supervisors\, recorder\, sh
 eriff\, county attorney\, assessor\, treasurer\, school superintendent)\n-
  State: All 90 state legislature seats\n- State: Three Corporation Commiss
 ion seats\n- State: Statewide ballot measures\, if any qualify (expected\,
  not yet official)\n- Federal: President\n- Federal: U.S. Senate (the seat
  Mark Kelly holds)\n- Federal: All nine U.S. House seats\nSee your exact b
 allot at https://my.arizona.vote\n\nYour checklist:\n☐ Check that you're
  registered: https://my.arizona.vote\n☐ Moved? Update your address by Oc
 tober 9\n☐ Want to vote by mail? Request an early ballot by October 27\,
  or join the Active Early Voting List to get one every election: https://r
 ecorder.maricopa.gov\n☐ See who and what is on your ballot: https://my.a
 rizona.vote\n☐ Learn about the candidates and measures in the Clean Elec
 tions voter guide: https://www.azcleanelections.gov\n☐ Decide how and wh
 en you'll vote\n\nWant help? https://chatgpt.com/?q=Help%20me%20get%20read
 y%20for%20the%20General%20election%20on%202028-11-07.%20I%20live%20in%20Ph
 oenix.\n\nCity info: https://www.phoenix.gov/elections\nCheck your registr
 ation: https://my.arizona.vote
URL:https://chatgpt.com/?q=Help%20me%20get%20ready%20for%20the%20General%20
 election%20on%202028-11-07.%20I%20live%20in%20Phoenix.
